    "description": "Classroom Bank Demo REST API. Implements FR-13 of the requirements document: every endpoint can be exercised from Postman. Fictional data only.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Set {{baseUrl}} (default http://localhost:8080).\n2. Run 'Auth / 01 Login customer1' first — Postman keeps the JSESSIONID cookie for the rest.\n3. Use the folders in order. Each request asserts its own expected status code, so the collection doubles as a smoke test.\n\nPassword for all five sample users: Demo@1234",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
